// AWS Secrets Manager Resource Policy Modified  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1098
// Detects changes to a secret's resource policy (PutResourcePolicy). Granting GetSecretValue to an external account or '*' backdoors access…
// False positives: Legitimate cross-account secret sharing (allowlist known accounts).
// Source: rules/credential-access/secretsmanager-put-resource-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventName=="PutResourcePolicy" and eventSource=="secretsmanager.amazonaws.com"
